1252.description:
The Saboteur – a captivating adventure in which you become a true saboteur. This time, you'll fight the Nazis, carrying out various acts of sabotage, assassinating their officers, destroying their technology, and liberating entire cities from their influence. No, you won't be fighting for the idea of freedom; it's just that one day, a German officer offended you, then deprived you of everything, and even managed to humiliate you. It was this turning point that forced the protagonist to side with the resistance and begin wreaking havoc. Use everything at your disposal, don't forget about your weapons, and try to carry out as many acts of sabotage as possible, from blowing up tanks and airships to blowing up bridges and special-purpose trains. The time has come to drive the Nazis from your lands!

Game features:
- the game takes place in Paris, where you will have to use local landmarks to your advantage: you can shoot enemies from the Eiffel Tower, hide in famous Parisian taverns, or climb to the roof of Notre Dame and carry out sabotage from there, destroying Nazi aircraft;
- for a successful sabotage operation, it is necessary to resort to professional camouflage skills, try to collect the necessary information and use all this for your own purposes, the enemy should not expect your attack and also should not have time to track you down, act carefully and as effectively as possible;
- a unique and unforgettable story awaits you, with various unexpected twists and huge opportunities for character development and city liberation;
- while the city is captured by the fascists, it will seem gloomy, dark and sleepy, but as soon as one or another part of the city is liberated, it will immediately be painted in the bright rainbow colors of a free city;
- Change history, destroy the fascists and restore faith to the people who are striving to free themselves from the shackles of these impudent invaders.

Installation:
1. Install the game following the setup instructions;
2. Play.

